From d459502782d8a6f8c9f6d19000e0ee38e820f8c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnnyC96 <54557697+JohnnyC96@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:48:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 103/104] IOP: ReferModuleStatus reports the module's .iopmod
 version

0102's ReferModuleStatus left the version 0, and SMAP refuses a DEV9 older than 2.4 ("smap: dev9 module version must be
2.4 or later"): the game then said no network adapter was connected. IopModuleLoader::moduleVersion reads the u16 at
.iopmod offset 24 (before the name); the test module now checks a 2.4 version. Fails without: 4/5 IOP suites.
---
